      "order": 25,
      "layout": "Text",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "\"At first, we engaged in a large research project to study how to preserve information across geologic eons…Scientists realized that in terms of data longevity, storage devices from our time were better. They found some USB flash drives and hard drives from the Common Era and some still had recoverable data!…But none of these were a match for printed material.\""
        ],
        "url": ""
